This slide uses by a 2x2 array of images
along with their locations on a map.
The bounds of the map (upper left (nw) and 
lower right (se) lat/long pairs) are defined using geo URI variables, 
and the image locations (obtained from the image metadata) are also defined.

Next, the slide title is set and the geographic elements
are shown. Finally, the image array is set, using the previously 
defined variables (row1, col1, row2, col2)
